{
  "bodyHash": "1C3kjc2Flas=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一个 Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">双门模组是一个极简主义模组，增加了同时打开相同的双门、活板门和栅栏门的功能。这可以通过点击任意一扇（木）门、单个压力板或按钮实现。默认情况下，模组还会查找并打开其他相连的门类方块，最多可达10个方块距离。此功能可在配置中开关。&nbsp;村民也能打开双门！<br><br>潜行将禁用双门功能，仅打开/关闭单个方块。<br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:20px\"><strong>如果你希望栅栏门和活板门也能实现“双开”，请务必在配置中启用！</strong><br><br></span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-rpg-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/rpg-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum's RPG Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableRecursiveOpening</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否启用递归开启功能。这允许你例如使用活板门建造一扇巨型门，只要它们相连，所有门都会同时打开。'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置选项决定了该功能的搜索范围。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 10，最小 1，最大 32</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当 'enableRecursiveOpening' 启用时，递归函数应搜索的方块数量。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableDoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用时，模组作用于双门。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFenceGates</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用时，模组作用于双栅栏门。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableTrapdoors</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用时，模组作用于双活板门。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableModIncompatibilityCheck</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">检查是否加载了其他具有双门功能的模组。如果发现，则在其配置中修改一行以禁用双门。修复因代码重复运行导致的门无法打开问题。</span><br><br></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于所有双门配置，还能递归地作用于所有其他门类方块！</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"332\"><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>任何相连的门类方块都会被递归识别并打开：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/b.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>默认情况下，递归函数会打开10格距离内的方块，但可通过 'recursiveOpeningMaxBlocksDistance' 配置更改：</strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/c.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"846\" height=\"472\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>点击任意一扇门，另一扇也会随之打开：</span></strong><br></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/d.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"848\" height=\"428\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>通过单个按钮打开铁门，或任何其他配置。</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/e.webp\" alt=\"gif1\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>适用于上下叠放的活板门和栅栏门，可通过点击或压力板/按钮操作。</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/f.webp\" alt=\"gif2\" width=\"1000\" height=\"506\"></p>\n</div><p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>村民也能打开双门！</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/double-doors/h.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何整合包中自由使用本模组，只要下载文件仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论功能已禁用，因为我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪它们。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
